```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant API
    participant EventBus
    participant DiscoveryAgent
    participant AnalysisAgent
    participant SupplierAgent
    participant PricingAgent
    participant InventoryAgent
    
    User->>API: POST /products/discover<br/>(budget: 3000)
    API->>EventBus: TrendDiscoveryRequested event
    
    EventBus->>DiscoveryAgent: deliver event
    
    DiscoveryAgent->>DiscoveryAgent: Get trending keywords
    DiscoveryAgent->>DiscoveryAgent: Search products (SerpAPI)
    DiscoveryAgent->>DiscoveryAgent: Filter & rank products
    DiscoveryAgent->>EventBus: ProductDiscovered event<br/>(15 products)
    
    EventBus->>AnalysisAgent: deliver ProductDiscovered
    
    par Parallel Analysis
        AnalysisAgent->>AnalysisAgent: Calculate profitability
        AnalysisAgent->>AnalysisAgent: Analyze demand
        AnalysisAgent->>AnalysisAgent: Evaluate competition
    end
    
    AnalysisAgent->>EventBus: AnalysisComplete event<br/>(recommendation: BUY)
    
    par Parallel Processing
        EventBus->>SupplierAgent: deliver AnalysisComplete
        EventBus->>PricingAgent: deliver AnalysisComplete
    end
    
    SupplierAgent->>SupplierAgent: Search suppliers
    SupplierAgent->>SupplierAgent: Generate messages (OpenAI)
    SupplierAgent->>EventBus: SupplierContactGenerated
    
    PricingAgent->>PricingAgent: Calculate optimal price
    PricingAgent->>EventBus: PriceOptimized event
    
    EventBus->>InventoryAgent: PriceOptimized event
    InventoryAgent->>InventoryAgent: Initialize inventory tracking
    InventoryAgent->>EventBus: InventoryUpdated event
    
    EventBus->>API: aggregate all events
    API->>User: WebSocket update<br/>(real-time results)
    
    Note over User,InventoryAgent: Complete pipeline: ~40 seconds<br/>(vs 120s in V1)
```

